WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:07,820
Look, how about using this long sword today? Or use this plasma axe?

2
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:11,661
Which one is taller and longer?

3
00:00:11,661 --> 00:00:16,050
Remember to bring one for Laila

4
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:21,070
Me? Today I will let you see what cold weapons are

5
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:27,390
Just bring me a long knife

6
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:32,560
This is from the past, this is yours

7
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:35,560
I made the right choice. This hair suits you very well.

8
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:41,231
The ongoing matches will be played here

9
00:00:41,231 --> 00:00:44,840
